\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Jesus, I will trust Thee, trust
\par Thee with my soul;
\par Guilty, lost, and helpless, Thou
\par canst make me whole,
\par There is none in heaven or on
\par earth like Thee;
\par Thou hast died for sinners, therefore,
\par Lord, for me.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par In Thy love confiding, 
\par I will seek Thy face,
\par Worship and adore Thee for 
\par Thy wondrous grace.
\par Jesus, I will trust Thee, 
\par Trust Thee with my soul;
\par Guilty, lost, and helpless, 
\par Thou canst make me whole.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Jesus, I will trust Thee, trust
\par Thy written Word;
\par Since Thy voice of mercy I have
\par often heard.
\par When Thy Spirit teacheth, 
\par To my taste how sweet,
\par Only may I hearken, sitting at Thy 
\par feet.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par In Thy love confiding, 
\par I will seek Thy face,
\par Worship and adore Thee for 
\par Thy wondrous grace.
\par Jesus, I will trust Thee, 
\par Trust Thee with my soul;
\par Guilty, lost, and helpless, 
\par Thou canst make me whole.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Jesus, I will trust Thee, trust
\par Thy ways,
\par Full of love and mercy all Thine
\par earthly days:
\par Sinners gathered round Thee, 
\par lepers sought Thy face,
\par None too vile or loathsome for a
\par Saviour's grace.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par In Thy love confiding, 
\par I will seek Thy face,
\par Worship and adore Thee for 
\par Thy wondrous grace.
\par Jesus, I will trust Thee, 
\par Trust Thee with my soul;
\par Guilty, lost, and helpless, 
\par Thou canst make me whole.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Jesus, I will trust Thee, trust
\par Thee without doubt;
\par Whosoever cometh Thou wilt not
\par cast out:
\par Faithful is Thy promise,
\par precious is Thy blood-
\par These my soul's salvation,
\par Thou my Saviour God.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par In Thy love confiding, 
\par I will seek Thy face,
\par Worship and adore Thee for 
\par Thy wondrous grace.
\par Jesus, I will trust Thee, 
\par Trust Thee with my soul;
\par Guilty, lost, and helpless, 
\par Thou canst make me whole.
\par \f1 
